  <para style="h">1 Atasaloniyi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Atasaloniyi Kpmisnuyi</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Atasaloniyi</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Ata</para>
  <para style="mt1">Atasaloniyi Kpmisnuyi</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TH 1" />
  <para style="po">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 1:1" />Bwulus, Sila n Timotii.</para>
  <para style="po" vid="1TH 1:1">Kwo lo da Ikilisiya Atasaloniyi nya nu, n ɓa fyi n Shekwoyi Dada ɓədo n Dagayi Yeisu Kirisitii nyi.</para>
  <para style="po" vid="1TH 1:1">Shebmyashi n bwugbafui ɓa kwu kwnusnu n fyei.<verse eid="1TH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Amisaga ntu Atasaloniyi gaiciyaganunui ɓo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 1:2" />Yi sa Shekwoyi ami lo ciici ntu əfye ɓo vnyanya, yii sa əfye aye ciici fyi n əyi aduwazhni. <verse eid="1TH 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 1:3" />Yi pá əfye tnutnu ɓo lo gnyi n Shekwoyi əyi Dadai abye, n fye ɓə zhni kwo dna n gaiciyaganunui nyi. Əfye tnutnu, ń yeye nu ɓə dna fye kwo zhni nyi, jesnu əfye bwugbaɓwa n awyetui dna n əyi Dagayi Yeisu Kirisiti.<verse eid="1TH 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 1:4" />Ntuge yi kpəlo, əyi azaje, azanugbai n anyikwozai n Shekwoyi ye fye nyi, nge wo la fye knyi, <verse eid="1TH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 1:5" />ntuge əyi nabagyi manai to ɓə ɓe da fye, n ɓwasnu n aɓədagbmai nu m, ama ɓədo n kalái, ɓədo n Zafnu Gyigyiyii n bwugbaknyi loloyi. Fye kpəlo she yi ɓə gyianyì fyi n əfye atasni ntu əfye ɓo. <verse eid="1TH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 1:6" />Fye ɓə kwu zè aza n ɓa shna yi, ɓədo n Dagayii, ntuge fye ɓə la ɓədatnu gwo fyi n azhnìgye yaakwo atasni n agbmadai ń Zafnu Gyigyiyi ɓə ga nyi. <verse eid="1TH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 1:7" />Ntulonu əfye n fyehni, fya kwu zè aɓəmwiyi n agaiciyagayi vnyanya aba n ɓa fyi n Makidoninya n Akaiyai nyi. <verse eid="1TH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 1:8" />Dagayi ɓədatnu ɓə gwoawyiya n əfye nu, toge n ɓwasnu fyi n Makidoninya n Akaiyai m; a kwu əfye gaiciyaganunui fyi n Shekwoyi kpeye n ɓwahoɓwahoi. Ntucenu yi to n ɓəhoi lo ya shna da ntu əkwo ɓo m, <verse eid="1TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 1:9" />ntuge əɓa n ɓahnii, ɓa ɓə kwu nabagyi da ntu gwogwo pya ɓo n fye ɓə gwo yi ncei nyi. Ɓa kwu da shi fye ɓə pmyiawyeya n ashna fya gwo Shekwoyi nabai fya zhni Shekwoyi hnihnii n wyewyeyidai tnutnu, <verse eid="1TH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 1:10" />jesnu ntuge fya pmi əwo Nugwnu n wo gbmi n əshemi, n wo ɓə la wo kala n əfyi, Yeisu, n wo gnyi yi n minagyi napyei n kwo ɓe lo nyi.<verse eid="1TH 1:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TH 2" />
  <para style="s1">Bwulus ɓəvyitnutnu dna n Tasalonika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 2:1" />Fye kpəlo, əmi azaje azanugbai n anyikwozai, nge əyi gnaɓyi ɓeɓe, n əfye aba, to ɓə zhni gbəloi nu m. <verse eid="1TH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 2:2" />Yi ɓəə kwu azhnìgye n shnisnu, jesnu a kwu awyesnugbegye ɓo wu yi fyi n Fyilibyi, ngye shi fye kpəlo nyi, ama ǹ əyi Shekwoyi bmazhnii, ya pawye ya gna fye əwo nabagyi manai ai gnyiapaapa n əyii n akalái. <verse eid="1TH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 2:3" />Ntuge əyi ɓwatna ta gbmiɓe n abaɓwi nu kwo ɓənubwozhni nukwoi m, kwo nge, yi ye ya dna fye kwoce nu m. <verse eid="1TH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 2:4" />Ama n əkwoɓwi, yi daɓo ngye aza nu n Shekwoyi wo la əgbe ga nge a la nabagyi manai fnyi ɓa əɓwa. Yi ta ye əyi əɓo kwa da azanyikwoci nu m, ama Shekwoyi, n wo nu mwu əyi adu nyi. <verse eid="1TH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 2:5" />Fye kpəlo nge yi to ɓə zhni apma n nyitala dadai nu m, nanyinanyi, kwo ya kwu əyi fnana pwuanya m, Shekwoyi nu zhni əyi ɓəgbmiyi. <verse eid="1TH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 2:6" />Yi to ɓə zhni yii ye azanyikwoci cici nu m, toge n əfye aba kwo n əzaho m, kwo shikwonyi ngye Kirisiti atnutnuloyi, yi ɓə ɓa kwu apmazhni n əyi ikwoi tu n fye. <verse eid="1TH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 2:7" />Ama yi ɓə wu ngye aɓyi nu n əfye atasni.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TH 2:7">N ɓwasnu shi əɓyiya wu əwo yeye ga əwo aɓyinawyii nyi, <verse eid="1TH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 2:8" />nlonu əyihni yi ɓə kwu fye wnakna. Ntuge yi ɓə kwu ye n fyei n mwa, fyi n bwugbada, ya da fye Shekwoyi nabagyi manai jesnu ya wu fye əyi anyìgyi ce. <verse eid="1TH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 2:9" />Ɓəhnihni fye pá lo, əyi azaje azanugbai n anyikwozai, əyi tnutnu n azhnìgyei; yi ɓə zhni tnutnu n nyipyei n sukwoi, nabai to ya tu zahozahoyi azhnì, əsa n yi ɓə fyi zhi n Shekwoyi nabagyi manai waazizhni ga fye m. <verse eid="1TH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 2:10" />Fye zhni aɓəgbmiyi nu, nlonu Shekwoyi; ngye shi yi ɓə zhni aza gyigyiyi, aɓəfyeceyi jesnu atnaɓətuyi fyi ń fye atasni, n fye ɓə kwu gaiciyaga nyi. <verse eid="1TH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 2:11" />Ntuge fye kpəlo nge yi ɓə kwu znazna n zahozahoyi n əfye mi, ngye shi əda zhni wa znazna n wohni aɓyii nu nyi. <verse eid="1TH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 2:12" />Yii myi fye zhi, yii fu fye abwugba jesnu yii gyiwye nge fye gyianyì n kwnuce n Shekwoyii, n wo nu ɓə yi fye fyi n əwo əbemi ɓədo n latui nyi.<verse eid="1TH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 2:13" />Njesnu əyihni ce, yi sa Shekwoyi ami lo ciici ntuge, əsa n fye ɓə gwo Shekwoyi ɓədagbma ncei nyi, n fye ɓə wo ń yi nyi, fye to ɓə gwo kwo ngye azanyikwoci ɓədagbma nu m, ama ngye shi kwo kwusnu lo, Shekwoyi ɓədagbma, n əkwo nu lo tnutnu fyi n fye, ń fye kwu gaiciyaga nyi. <verse eid="1TH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 2:14" />Ntuge əfye, əyi azaje azanugbai n anyikwozai, fye ɓə kwu zè aza n ɓa shna Shekwoyi ikilisiya n ɓa nyi ń Yahudi əknyi n fyi n Kirisiti Yeisu nyi. Fye ɓə kwu azhnìgye fyi n əfyehni aza akwnu, ngye shi aikilisiya dəyi ɓə gyeazhnì fyi ń Ayahudiyi akwnu nyi, <verse eid="1TH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 2:15" />ń ɓa ɓə wu Dagayi Yeisu ɓədo n sheaɓəgwognayii jesnu ɓa nya yi ya. Ɓa ɓə la Shekwoyi wnubwugba, jesnu ɓai pwunú n azai vnyanya <verse eid="1TH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 2:16" />ǹ əɓahni mwakpe, to ɓa ye nge yi zhni Abyedo waazi nabai ɓa ɓwa gnyignyi m. N zokwo ye nu, ń əɓa aleifyi yekpeaje gna mwamwa. Shekwoyi minagyi napyei kwo la kpma ɓe tu ń əɓa tukwo.<verse eid="1TH 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bwulus ɓəpwawo wa gye Atasaloniyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 2:17" />Ama əyi azaje azanugbai n anyikwozai, she a ɓə la yi gnaje, a kwu yi zè akwuwyi, əsa fyewyi nya (n nayi, toge n ɓənubwozhni m), fyi n əyi ɓəpwawo yaakwo ya əyihni mwakpe n zokwo dəhodəhoi nge ya gye fye awye. <verse eid="1TH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 2:18" />Ntuge ɓəhnihni yi ɓə ncei pma ya ɓe da fye, əmi Bwulus, ma kwu zhni, mii jezhni, ama Shetam waa zokwo gwù yi. <verse eid="1TH 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 2:19" />Knyiyi nu zhni əyi awyetu, əyi bwugbabwui, kwo fnunyi n yi ɓə ɓwa latu n Dagayi Yeisu abye, əsa n wo ɓə ɓe a? Əfye nu to m? <verse eid="1TH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 2:20" />Ɓəhnihni əfye nu zhni əyi latu n bwugbabwui.<verse eid="1TH 2:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TH 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 3:1" />Ntulonu she yi ɓə gye kwoi du yi akalá, ya gye kwo dulo ya kwu kpefyi n Atens əyihniyihni. <verse eid="1TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 3:2" />Ya tnu fye n Timotii, n wo zhni əyido nyi jesnu Shekwoyi tnutnu kwnuzhniyi dna n Kirisiti nabagyi manai gnamyi, nabai wa dna fye bwugbakala jesnu wa ga fye agwumyi dna n əfye gaiciyaganunui. <verse eid="1TH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 3:3" />Nabai n əzaho taa ɓwa ashnaje n amwimwi ye ɓo m. Ntuge fye kpəlo dəidəi nge a ɓə zhni yi n əɓa ɓo nu. <verse eid="1TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 3:4" />Ɓəhnihni, əsa n yi ɓə kwnusnu n fyei nyi, yi ɓə zhni yii gna fye ciici nge a ɓə wu yi awyesnugbegye ɓo. Njesnu kwaa zè nlonu, ngye shi fye kpəlo nyi. <verse eid="1TH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 3:5" />Ntucenu, she mi to ɓə ye myi n ɓəye shi m, ma tnu nabai a kpe əfye gaiciyaganunui əɓo ye. Mi ɓə gnyi mii wodna nu nge kwo a ɓa gye əzamwuyi wo kwu fye mwi jesnu əyi tnutnu kwo ɓə ɓa kwu zè gbəloi.<verse eid="1TH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Timoti əɓədokwu wu agwumyizhi nya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 3:6" />Ama nsaiye Timoti n la jezeɓe da yi woi gbmi n əfye aba, wonyi la ɓe yi n nabagyi manai ntu əfye gaiciyaganunui ɓo n yeyei. Wo kwu gna yi nge fye pá yi ɓo lo n bwugbadai ciici jesnu nge awyekwo fye lo, fya gye yi, n ɓwasnu shi awyekwoyi yi lo ce ya gye fye nyi. <verse eid="1TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 3:7" />Ntucenu, əyi azaje azanugbai n anyikwozai, dna n əyi bwugbawnu vnyanya n awyesnugbegye ɓoi, yi ɓə kwu agwumyi ɓwa ń əfye ɓo, ntu n əfye gaiciyaganunui ɓo. <verse eid="1TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 3:8" />Ntuge nsaiye nu n yi gyianyì ɓəhnihni nya, shikwonyi nge fye myizhi lo dna n Dagayi. <verse eid="1TH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 3:9" />Yi ɓa sa Shekwoyi ami n wunanu n kwnuce n fye ɓo n bwugbabwui vnyanya, n yi ɓwa n əyi Shekwoyi aba ntu n əfye ɓo nyi a? <verse eid="1TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 3:10" />N nyipyei n sukwoi yi zhniaduwa n əwyei bmyibmyii nabai n yi ɓə je fye wyegye jesnu yii ga fye ənya n kwo ceya lo n əfye gaiciyaganunui.<verse eid="1TH 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 3:11" />Nsaiye, fa əyi Shekwoyi n Dadai, n əwohni tukwo ɓədo n əyi Dagayi Yeisui, wa gwu zokwo ya ga yi ya ɓe əfye aba. <verse eid="1TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 3:12" />Fa Dagayi wa zhni əfye yeye kwa mwaɓe jesnu kwa zheya n fye ga aje, n ɓwasnu shi əyi nya zheya ga əfye nyi. <verse eid="1TH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 3:13" />Fa wa fyi əfye adu akalá nabai n fye ɓə kwu zhi a tnaɓətui jesnu n gyigyiyi n əyi Shekwoyi aba ɓədo n Dadai, she əyi Dagayi Yeisu ɓə ɓe n əwo agyigyiyii vnyanya.<verse eid="1TH 3:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TH 4" />
  <para style="s1">Anyìgyi n kwo dá Shekwoyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 4:1" />Ntu aɓo aje ɓo, əyi azaje azanugbai n anyikwozai, yi ɓə la əgbega ga fye shi fye ɓa gyianyì n wu kwa da Shekwoyi, n ɓwasnu ngye shi fye gyianyì lo nyi. Nsaiye yi gna fye jesnu yii gyi fye ce dna n Dagayi Yeisu, nge fye zhni nlonu n dudu. <verse eid="1TH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 4:2" />Ntuge fye kpe agbega ye lo n yi ɓə ga fye n ikwo Dagayi Yeisu nyai.<verse eid="1TH 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 4:3" />Shekwoyi ɓəye nu, nge fye kwu zhi n pmyapmyai: nge fyaa pəya n asisiɓozhni; <verse eid="1TH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 4:4" />nge zahozahoyi n fye wo tumwi wa wna wohni nayi shi n zokwo gyigyiyi jesnu n mwamwai, <verse eid="1TH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 4:5" />toge dna n fnafnakwnu shakpe nayi nya, ngye Abyedo m, n ɓa ta kpe Shekwoyi əye lo nyi m; <verse eid="1TH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 4:6" />jesnu nge ntu ɓəye ɓo, zahozahoyi to bwu əwo ədo m, zanugbai n nyikwozai, kwo wa gyi wo fyi m. Dagayi ɓə ta aza yi vnyanya, n ɓa zhni aleifyi ye pya, ngye shi yi ɓə kwu shni fye gna jesnu yii kpma fye nyi. <verse eid="1TH 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 4:7" />Ntuge Shekwoyi to yi yi ya kwu zè adodnai nu m, ama ya gyianyì n gyigyiyi. <verse eid="1TH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 4:8" />Ntucenu, zahozahoyi n wa na gbega ye aɓo, wo ta na zanyikwoci nu aɓo m, ama Shekwoyi, n wo ga fye əwo Zafnu Gyigyiyi nyi.<verse eid="1TH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 4:9" />Nsaiye ntu n əfye yeye ɓo ga aje, kwo to gwo ya shna nyaho ka ga fye m, ntuge əfye n əfyehni, Shekwoyi wo kwu wu fye nge fye ye n ajei. <verse eid="1TH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 4:10" />Njesnu ɓəhnihni, fye ye Shekwoyi pwuwa lo n Makidoninya əknyi vnyanya. Dudulonu yi gyiwye lo, əyi aje azanugbai n anyikwozai, nge fye zhni kwo n dudu ɓo,<verse eid="1TH 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 4:11" />jesnu fyaa kwo zè əfye ɓəmwi fya gyianyì pəceye, fya əwye ce n əfye aɓwaze jesnu fya zhni tnutnu n əfye aɓwai, n ɓwasnu shi yi ɓə gna fye nyi, <verse eid="1TH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 4:12" />nabai n əfye anyìgyi fyegyifyegyi nya ɓa zhni abmyida ɓa ga fye mwamwa jesnu nabai to fya kpəma n zahozahoyi m.<verse eid="1TH 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Agaiciyagayi n ɓa kwu fyí</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 4:13" />Əyi azaje azanugbai n anyikwozai, yi to ncei pmalo fya kwu zhi n ɓəyebwi, ntu aza yi ɓo n ɓa kwu wnagye fyi n əfyi nyi m, nabai to fya wnubwugba ngye azanyikwoci aje, n ɓa to n awyetui lo nyi m. <verse eid="1TH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 4:14" />Ntuge yi n gaiciyagai lo, nge Yeisu ɓə la fyí jesnu waa laka, nlonu yi n gaiciyagai lo nge Shekwoyi ɓə ɓe n aza yii n kwnusnu n Yeisui n ɓa kwu wnagye fyi n wo nyi. <verse eid="1TH 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 4:15" />N vyi Dagayi ɓədagbma, yi gna fye nge əyi n yi ye zhilo n wyewyeyi nyi, ń yi cezhi, nya Dagayi ɓeɓe sa nyi, ɓəhnihni yi to ɓə kwu gyi n aza yi abye n ɓa kwu wnagye nyi m. <verse eid="1TH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 4:16" />Ntuge Dagayi n wohnii tukwoi nu ɓə shnizhi ɓe n əshemi, n əgbetu yaakwoi, n bəgye amaləka tukwoda nyai, n mwayi yiyi Shekwoyi nyai jesnu azafyifyiyi, fyi n Kirisiti, nu ɓə kpmi kalakwu. <verse eid="1TH 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 4:17" />N dəye avnu, əyi n yi ɓə zhi n wyewyeyi nyi, jesnu n cezhi nyi, yi ɓə shegwnu aje n ɓai n ənyi, yii snu n Dagayii n əshebmana. Nlonu n yi ɓə kwnusnu n Dagayii nyalonyalo. <verse eid="1TH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 4:18" />Ntucenu fye kwu aje agwumyizhi n aɓədagbma yei.<verse eid="1TH 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TH 5" />
  <para style="s1">Dagayi nyipyei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 5:1" />Nsaiye, əyi azaje azanugbai n anyikwozai, ntu asa ɓo n anyipyeii n aɓo ye ɓə zhni ncei, kwo to n apmai lo ya kanya ga fye ntu n əɓa ɓo m, <verse eid="1TH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 5:2" />ntuge fye kpəlo dəidəi nge, Dagayi nyipyei ɓə ɓe ngye əvyì nu dna n sukwo. <verse eid="1TH 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 5:3" />Əsa n aza zhi lo ɓai gna, “Bwugbafu n lafyiyai,” agbmazhni ɓə ɓe kpe ɓa n əsagbmanyii, shi əɓyima nyasna ɓe kpe nyikwo nubwoda, jesnu ɓa to ɓə pwo m.<verse eid="1TH 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 5:4" />Ama əfye, əyi azaje azanugbai n anyikwozai, fye to fyilo n wyegbma nu, n nyipyei yi ɓə je fye jeje ngye əvyì m. <verse eid="1TH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 5:5" />Fye zhni aɓyi bwuznagna nya nu vnyanya jesnu aɓyi nyipyei nya. Yi to zhni aɓyi sukwo nya nu kwo wyegbma nya m. <verse eid="1TH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 5:6" />Ntulonu, yi to kwu wu ngye azaje nu n ɓa kwu wnagye nyi m, ama yi kwu zhi n zhni agyewyikwnui jesnu n nazhi. <verse eid="1TH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 5:7" />Ntuge aza yi n ɓa wnagye, ɓa wnagye n sukwoi nu, jesnu aza yi n ɓa fyije, ɓa fyije n sukwoi nu. <verse eid="1TH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 5:8" />Ama shikwonyi yi zhni nyipyei nya nu nyi, fa yaa nazhi, ya kwu gaiciyaganunui kpe ɓədo n yeyei ngye agwu-kpata, jesnu n awyetu gnyignyi nyai kwnu ngye snuknakàta. <verse eid="1TH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 5:9" />Ntuge Shekwoyi to ɓə knyí yi ya gyeazhnì minagyi napyei nya nu m, ama ya gwo gnyignyi dna n əyi Dagayi Yeisu Kirisiti. <verse eid="1TH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 5:10" />Wo ɓə fyí ntu n yi ɓo nu, nabai nge, kwo yii zhi n wyewyeyi, kwo yii kwu wnagye nu, n yi ɓa kwnu anyìgyi n woi. <verse eid="1TH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 5:11" />Ntucenu fye kwu aje agwumyizhi jesnu fya mi aje zhi, n ɓwasnu shi fye zhni lo nyi.<verse eid="1TH 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Agbega kpmasnui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 5:12" />Nsaiye, əyi azaje azanugbai n anyikwozai, yi gna fye nge fye sa aza yi ami n ɓa zhni tnutnu n wyei bmyibmyii fyi n fye atasni, aza n ɓa wna fye akna fyi n Dagayi, jesnu ɓai dna fye n zokwo nyi. <verse eid="1TH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 5:13" />Fye shi ɓa n mwamwaga yaakwoi dna n yeye ntu n əɓa tnutnu ɓo. Fye sase n bwugbafui n ajei. <verse eid="1TH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 5:14" />Njesnu yi gyiwye, əyi azaje azanugbai n anyikwozai, fye gnaknyi aɓwatoi ɓədo n atawoɓoi, fye myi adukalagbayi agwuzhi, fye bma akalágbayi zhni, fye ɓwa bwugba n zahozahoyii. <verse eid="1TH 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 5:15" />Fye gye nge zahozahoyi to gbá ɓənukwoi əta n ɓənukwoi m, ama n əsahosahoii fye la əwye nyi fya zhni abmyazhni ga aje jesnu ga zahozahoyi ce.<verse eid="1TH 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 5:16" />Fye dagbma ciici; <verse eid="1TH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 5:17" />fye zhniaduwa n sahosahoii, <verse eid="1TH 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 5:18" />dna n ɓəhoɓəhoi vnyanya fye ga amisa; ntuge Shekwoyi ɓəye nu nyi ga fye dna n Kirisiti Yeisu.<verse eid="1TH 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 5:19" />Fye to wnu Zafnu əná m; <verse eid="1TH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 5:20" />fye to gwo sheaɓəgwogna n agyekpei m. <verse eid="1TH 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TH 5:21" />Ama fye mwi ɓa vnyanya; fye la ənya shiɓwa n kwo bmya, <verse eid="1TH 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TH 5:22" />fye na nukwoi dəhodəhoi pya aɓo.<verse eid="1TH 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TH 5:23" />Fa Shekwoyi n əwohni tukwoi, Shekwoyi bwugbafu nya, wa pmya fye woi je pmya. Fa əfye zafnu nunui, wyewyeyi ɓədo n nayii, ɓa kwu zhi ntnaɓətu, əsa n əyi Dagayi Yeisu Kirisiti ɓə ɓe nyi. <verse eid="1TH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TH 5:24" />Əwo n wo yi fye nyi, wo zhni gaiciyazhninunui nu, jesnu wo ɓa zhni əɓo n wa tugbe.<verse eid="1TH 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TH 5:25" />Əyi azaje azanugbai n anyikwozai, fye zhniaduwa ntu əyi ɓo.<verse eid="1TH 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1TH 5:26" />Fye ɓyi Shekwoyi aza vnyanya gna n ɓwadodna gyigyiyii.<verse eid="1TH 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1TH 5:27" />Mi tu fye ɓəgbe gnyi n Dagayi awyeba nge fye ba paka ye ga əyi azaje azanugbai n anyikwozai vnyanya.<verse eid="1TH 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1TH 5:28" />Shebmyashi Dagayi Yeisu Kirisiti nya ɓa kwnusnu n fyei.<verse eid="1TH 5:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 5" />
</usx>